Breakfast or Lodge or Self-catering facility.\n\nThe rate will include but is not limited to:\nΓÇó Accommodation in a Bed & Breakfast / Lodge / Self-catering etc.\nΓÇó Meals up to a maximum of R240.00\n\nNote:  where any of the mails are included in the accommodation or if only certain meals are claimed for, the following breakdown will apply and the R240 amount must be reduced in accordance with the meal amount:\n\nMeals Amount\nBreakfast R      72.00\nLunch R      54.00\nDinner R    114.00\n\nThe rate excludes daily transport costs from the accommodation to the site. Transport from the accommodation to the site may be claimed additionally, according to the 0 to 50km service fee rates.\n\nThis item may only be used for the 2nd and onwards consecutive day/s spent on site/s in conjunction with the initial Service fee items greater than a 200km radius.\n\nThe actual amount will be paid, up to a maximum of R800.00\n\nProof of the expenses must accompany the claim.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per person per day.','D',1.00,'PAY,FEE:G6.3 ACCOM B&B/LODGE/ S/C','PAY, FEE: TYPE G6.3 SERV FEE ACCOM B&B/ LODGE/ S/C : THE RATE WILL INCLUDE BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: ACCOMMODATION IN A BED &\nBREAKFAST / LODGE / SELF-CATERING ETC., MEALS UP TO A MAXIMUM OF R240.00. NOTE:  WHERE ANY OF THE MAILS ARE INCLUDED IN THE\nACCOMMODATION OR IF ONLY CERTAIN MEALS ARE CLAIMED FOR, THE FOLLOWING BREAKDOWN WILL APPLY AND THE R240 AMOUNT MUST BE REDUCED IN\nACCORDANCE WITH THE MEAL AMOUNT: MEALS AMOUNT, BREAKFAST R72.00, LUNCH R54.00, DINNER R114.00. THE RATE EXCLUDES DAILY TRANSPORT\nCOSTS FROM THE ACCOMMODATION TO THE SITE. TRANSPORT FROM THE ACCOMMODATION TO THE SITE MAY BE CLAIMED ADDITIONALLY, ACCORDING TO\nTHE 0 TO 50KM SERVICE FEE RATES. THIS ITEM MAY ONLY BE USED FOR THE 2ND AND ONWARDS CONSECUTIVE DAY/S SPENT ON SITE/S IN\nCONJUNCTION WITH THE INITIAL SERVICE FEE ITEMS GREATER THAN A 200KM RADIUS. THE ACTUAL AMOUNT WILL BE PAID, UP TO A MAXIMUM OF R800.\n00. PROOF OF THE EXPE