 BOXES, CLEANING UTILITY BOXES AND SURROUNDINGS ON\nCOMPLETION, SUPPLYING OF ALL MINOR MATERIAL (I.E. POLY # WATER, DRY AIR, CABLE TIES, FASTENERS, LABELS, SADDLES, GLUE, MICRO DUCT\nCOUPLERS, MICRO DUCT END CAPS ETC.), PERFORMING MICRO DUCT INTEGRITY TEST, THE RE-DRUMMING, TESTING, MEASURING, AND LABELLING OF\nSURPLUS CABLES / DUCTS, REMOVAL OF SURPLUS CABLES / DUCTS, CLEANING THE WORK SITE DURING AND ON COMPLETION OF THE WORK. FOR UG THE\nQUANTITY HAULED FOR PAYMENT WILL BE MEASURED FROM THE CENTRE OF A UB LID TO THE CENTRE OF THE OTHER UB LID IRRESPECTIVE OF ANY\nSLACK REQUIRED OR HANDLED. FOR INDOOR CABLE /DUCT THE QUANTITY HAULED FOR PAYMENT WILL BE MEASURED FROM POINT TO POINT OF THE\nACTUAL HAULED CABLE / DUCT LENGTH IRRESPECTIVE OF ANY SLACK REQUIRED OR HANDLED. THE PRICE PER METRE IS THE SAME FOR THE HAULING OF\n1 MIRCO-DUCT OR SIMULTANEOUS HAULING OF 2 MICRO-DUCTS FOR UG THE QUANTITY HAULED FOR PAYMENT WILL BE MEASURED FROM THE CENTRE OF A\nUB LID TO THE CENTRE OF THE OTHER UB LID IRRESPECTIVE OF ANY SLACK REQUIRED FOR INDOOR CABLE /DUCT THE QUANTITY HAULED FOR PAYMENT\nWILL BE MEASURED FROM POINT TO POINT OF THE ACTUAL HAULED CABLE / DUCT LENGTH IRRESPECTIVE OF ANY SLACK REQUIRED THE RATE EXCLUDES:\nTHE COST OF THE CABLE / DUCTS, SUPPLY OF SUPPORT BRACKETS (TO BE SUPPLIED BY TELKOM), ALL TRAVEL COSTS TO AND FROM SITE (SEE\nSERVICE FEE DOCUMENT). NOTE: FOR UG THE QUANTITY HAULED FOR PAYMENT WILL BE MEASURED FROM THE CENTRE OF A UB LID TO THE CENTRE OF'),(3045965,'CI1.15','CI1.15 PROVD BED & PAD','This item consists of the provision of imported bedding and padding material in compliance with schedule 2 or as specified (acquired from burrow pit or imported crusher).\n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to: \na) The acquiring, loading and transporting the material from the supply source and distributing the material along the entire length of the trench.  \n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel costs to and from site (See Service fee document).\n\nNote:\na) 