es.\n\nThe specification for this item is:\na) CTO-000043, \nb) CTO-007539,\nc) CTO-006426. \n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per fibre, end to end (EA)','EA',81.53,'TST,CBL:CI4.38,OPTIC FBR TRMNTD,<1KM','TEST, CABLE:ITEM NUMBER CI4.38, TYPE OPTIC FIBER TRMNTD, DISTANCE <1 KM:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: OLTS (OPTICAL LOSS\nTEST SET) TEST ONLY, SUBMITTING A SOFT COPY (DVD/CD) OF THE TEST RESULTS FOR EACH FIBRE TESTED TO TELKOM (C.R./SPOC) AND UPON\nREQUEST ALSO PROVIDING A PRINTOUT COPY OF THE TEST RESULTS. THE RATE EXCLUDES: ALL TRAVEL RELATED COSTS (SEE SERVICE FEE ITEMS).\nNOTE: THIS ITEM MAY ALSO BE USED FOR THE TESTING OF OPTIC PATCH TAILS AND OPTIC TIE CABLES. THE SPECIFICATION FOR THIS ITEM IS:\nCTO-000043, CTO-007539, CTO-006426. THE UNIT OF MEASURE FOR THIS ITEM IS PER FIBRE, END TO END (EA)'),(3046045,'CI3.22','CI3.22 RETN AERL & FO CABL','This item consists of the re-tensioning of all sizes existing aerial and optic fibre cables.  \n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to:\na) The loosening of cable support clamps, re-tensioning of the cable and re-fitting of suspension wire in cable support clamps, \nb)  The retention of the existing screen wire,  \nc) The testing of poles when working on all existing poles / routes. The Service Provider is responsible to ensure that all existing poles are safe to be worked on. \n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel costs to and from site (See Service fee document).\n\nThe specification for this item is:\na) SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), \nb) WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987),  \nc) B3001 (CTO-003944), \nd) PR-AH0003. CTO-000706.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per cable per pole.','MT',1.91,'RETNSN,CBL:CI3.22,AERL & FO CABL','RETENSION, CABLE:ITEM NUMBER CI3.22, TYPE AERL & FO CABL:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: THE LOOSENING OF CABLE SUPPORT\nCLAMPS, RE-TENSIONING OF THE CABLE AND RE-FITTING OF SUSPENSION WIRE IN CABLE SUPPORT CLAMPS, THE RETENTION OF THE EXISTING SCREEN\nWIRE, THE TESTING OF POLES WHEN WORKING ON ALL EXISTING POLES / ROUTES. THE SERVICE PROVIDER IS RESPONSIBLE TO ENSURE THAT ALL\nEXISTING POLES ARE SAFE TO BE WORKED ON. THE RATE EXCLUDES: ALL TRAVEL COSTS TO AND FROM SITE (SEE SERVICE FEE DOCUMENT). THE\nSPECIFICATION FOR THIS ITEM IS: SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987), B3001 (CTO-003944), PR-AH0003. CTO-000706. THE UNIT\nOF MEASURE FOR THIS ITEM IS PER CABLE PER POLE'),(3046046,'CI3.17','CI3.17 LASHG CU & OPTIC CABL','This item consists of the lashing of all sizes copper cable and / or optic fibre cables on new and existing routes.\n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to:\na) Erecting and Lashing of copper or optic cables by means of a machine, \nb) 3m slack for UG cable and 30m for fibre optic cable per cable end. (left for termination or jointing purposes ΓÇô CRΓÇÖs approval), \nc) Clamping of the cable in the support clamps, \nd) The testing of poles when working on all poles / routes. The Service Provider is responsible to ensure that all poles are safe to be worked on.  \n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel costs to and from site (See Service fee document).\n\nThe specification for this item is:\na) SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), \nb) WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987),  \nc) B3001 (CTO-003944), \nd) PR-AH0003. CTO-000706.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per metre (MT).','MT',11.96,'LASH,CBL:CI3.17,CU & OPTIC','LASH, CABLE:ITEM NUMBER CI3.17, TYPE CU & OPTIC:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: ERECTING AND LASHING OF COPPER OR OPTIC\nCABLES BY MEANS OF A MACHINE, 3M SLACK FOR UG CABLE AND 30M FOR FIBRE OPTIC CABLE PER CABLE END. (LEFT FOR TERMINATION OR JOINTING\nPURPOSES CR#S APPROVAL), CLAMPING OF THE CABLE IN THE SUPPORT CLAMPS, THE TESTING OF POLES WHEN WORKING ON ALL POLES / ROUTES. THE\nSERVICE PROVIDER IS RESPONSIBLE TO ENSURE THAT ALL POLES ARE SAFE TO BE WORKED ON. THE RATE EXCLUDES: ALL TRAVEL COSTS TO AND FROM\nSITE (SEE SERVICE FEE DOCUMENT). THE SPECIFICATION FOR THIS ITEM IS: SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987), B3001\n(CTO-003944), PR-AH0003. CTO-000706. THE UNIT OF MEASURE FOR THIS ITEM IS PER METRE (MT)'),(3046047,'CI3.16','CI3.16 ERECT DRP WRE','This item consists of the erecting / replacing / repositioning / retention / recovery of drop wire complete with fittings \n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to:\na) The fitting of mounting brackets, insulators where applicable, loop fasteners, tensioning and termination, \nb) The loosening and the refastening of an existing drop wire on the same pole or from one pole to another when the drop wire is long enough, \nc) The replacement of brackets and insulators with loop fasteners, \nd) The fastening of the drop wire to a wall, \ne) The testing of poles when working on all existing poles / routes. The Service Provider is responsible to ensure that all existing poles are safe to be worked on.\n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel costs to and from site (See Service fee document).\n\nThe specification for this item is:\na) SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), \nb) WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987),  \nc) B3001 (CTO-003944), \nd) PR-AH0003. CTO-000706.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per span (EA).','EA',70.96,'ERCT,WRE:CI3.16,DRP','ERECT, WIRE:ITEM NUMBER CI3.16, TYPE DROP:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: THE FITTING OF MOUNTING BRACKETS, INSULATORS\nWHERE APPLICABLE, LOOP FASTENERS, TENSIONING AND TERMINATION, THE LOOSENING AND THE REFASTENING OF AN EXISTING DROP WIRE ON THE\nSAME POLE OR FROM ONE POLE TO ANOTHER WHEN THE DROP WIRE IS LONG ENOUGH, THE REPLACEMENT OF BRACKETS AND INSULATORS WITH LOOP\nFASTENERS, THE FASTENING OF THE DROP WIRE TO A WALL, THE TESTING OF POLES WHEN WORKING ON ALL EXISTING POLES / ROUTES. THE SERVICE\nPROVIDER IS RESPONSIBLE TO ENSURE THAT ALL EXISTING POLES ARE SAFE TO BE WORKED ON. THE RATE EXCLUDES: ALL TRAVEL COSTS TO AND FROM\nSITE (SEE SERVICE FEE DOCUMENT). THE SPECIFICATION FOR THIS ITEM IS: SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987), B3001\n(CTO-003944), PR-AH0003. CTO-000706. THE 