s from the field tester.\nb) Preparing the pre-qualification file in Telkom approved format.\nc) Capturing of test and speed qualification results into the pre-qualification file.\nd) Confirming and capturing the predicted DSL speed for DPΓÇÖs not tested, into the pre-qualification file.\ne) Submitting of pre-qualification file to Telkom for approval.\nf) Capturing of CBS ID and DSL speed rate onto DSL upload template provided.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per SDC area, (EA).','EA',1448.95,'CRET,DOC:CI4.37 CTS BBF PRE QUALFTN FILE','CREATE, DOCUMENT:TYPE CI4.37 CTS BBF PRE QUALFTN FILE:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: OBTAINING THE DSL TEST RESULTS FROM\nTHE FIELD TESTER. PREPARING THE PRE-QUALIFICATION FILE IN TELKOM APPROVED FORMAT. CAPTURING OF TEST AND SPEED QUALIFICATION RESULTS\nINTO THE PRE-QUALIFICATION FILE. CONFIRMING AND CAPTURING THE PREDICTED DSL SPEED FOR DP#S NOT TESTED, INTO THE PRE-QUALIFICATION\nFILE. SUBMITTING OF PRE-QUALIFICATION FILE TO TELKOM FOR APPROVAL. CAPTURING OF CBS ID AND DSL SPEED RATE ONTO DSL UPLOAD TEMPLATE\nPROVIDED. THE UNIT OF MEASURE FOR THIS ITEM IS PER SDC AREA, (EA).'),(3046051,'CI3.5','CI3.5 CREEP CTNG','This item consists of creeper cutting around a pole that is obstructing telephone \ninfrastructure and or access. \n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to:\na) Creepers only to be cut if instructed to do so by a site instruction from the contract representative,  \nb) Telkom to obtain permission from the owner to cut the creeper,  \nc) Cutting of the creeper from the pole up to and including 1m radius around the pole, \nd) The cost of removing, transporting and the disposing of the cut creepers,  \ne) Engineering difficulties such as avoiding damage to infrastructure and / or private property,  \nf) The clearing of the complete length of the pole or any other infrastructure mounted on the pole or part thereof. \n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel costs to and from site (See Service fee document).\n\nThe specification for this item is:\na) SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), \nb) WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987),  \nc) B3001 (CTO-003944), \nd) PR-AH0003. CTO-000706.\n\nThe unit of measure for this item is per pole each (EA).','EA',188.19,'CUT,BSH:CI3.5,CREEPER','CUT, BUSH:ITEM NUMBER CI3.5, TYPE CREEPER:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: CREEPERS ONLY TO BE CUT IF INSTRUCTED TO DO SO\nBY A SITE INSTRUCTION FROM THE CONTRACT REPRESENTATIVE, TELKOM TO OBTAIN PERMISSION FROM THE OWNER TO CUT THE CREEPER, CUTTING OF\nTHE CREEPER FROM THE POLE UP TO AND INCLUDING 1M RADIUS AROUND THE POLE, THE COST OF REMOVING, TRANSPORTING AND THE DISPOSING OF\nTHE CUT CREEPERS, ENGINEERING DIFFICULTIES SUCH AS AVOIDING DAMAGE TO INFRASTRUCTURE AND / OR PRIVATE PROPERTY, THE CLEARING OF THE\nCOMPLETE LENGTH OF THE POLE OR ANY OTHER INFRASTRUCTURE MOUNTED ON THE POLE OR PART THEREOF. THE RATE EXCLUDES: ALL TRAVEL COSTS TO\nAND FROM SITE (SEE SERVICE FEE DOCUMENT). THE SPECIFICATION FOR THIS ITEM IS: SP-AH0001 (CTO-004753), WI-AH0005 (CTO-000987), B3001\n(CTO-003944), PR-AH0003. CTO-000706. THE UNIT OF MEASURE FOR THIS ITEM IS PER POLE EACH (EA).'),(3046052,'CI2.40','CI2.40 INSTL FOMS','This item consists of the Installation of the Fibre Optic Management System (FOMS).\n\nThe rate includes but is not limited to:\na) Arranging and obtaining all site access control approvals,\nb) Obtaining all work refs.,\nc) Interface management with own or Telkom Sub-Contractors, when required,\nd) Labour for the installation of the equipment,\ne) Labelling,\nf) Minor build material,\ng) Submission of documentation, such as:\na. Quality acceptance certificate,\nb. Quality tick sheet,\nc. IE6 document.\n\nThe rate excludes:\na) All travel related costs (See Service fee items).\n\nThe unit of measure (UOM) for this item is per FOMS, each (EA).','EA',394.10,'INSTL,EQUIP:CI2.40,FOMS','INSTALL, EQUIPMENT:ITEM NUMBER CI2.40, TYPE FOMS:THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: ARRANGING AND OBTAINING ALL SITE ACCESS\nCONTROL 