ting of all as-built plant / elements after completion of the work on Telkom approved system software (i.e. NetPlan). \nc) Tasking to ECC \nd) All travel related costs up to a 50-km radius from the following dispatch points, to and from the site:\na. Pretoria, Middelburg, Klerksdorp, Polokwane, Vereeniging, Rustenburg.\nb. Johannesburg.\nc. Bellville (Cape Town), Worcester, Vredenburg, Swellendam\nd. Ethekwini (Durban), Richards bay, Pietermaritzburg, Newcastle.\ne. Nelson Mandela Metropolitan (Port Elizabeth), George, Buffalo City (East London), Mthatha (Umtata).\nf. Bloemfontein, Kimberley.\n\nThe rate excludes:\na) Travel related costs in the excess of a 50-km radius from the designated dispatch points (See Service fees).\n\nNote: This item may be only be claimed \na) Once per customer site irrespective of the number of services required.\nb) Once, in conjunction with ME engineering executable \n\nThe unit of measure (UOM) for this item is per customer site, each (EA)','EA',2039.68,'ENGNR,STE:ME10.4,ME FBR CMPLTN (KL)','ENGINEER, SITE:ITEM NUMBER ME10.4, TYPE ME FBR CMPLTN (KL):THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF THE AMENDMENTS OF THE DETAILED ENGINEERING DURING\nBUILD AND THE CAPTURING OF ALL AS-BUILT PLANT / ELEMENTS AFTER COMPLETION OF THE WORK FOR A METRO-ETHERNET CUSTOMER SITE (ME\nORDER/S) ON EXISTING OR NEW ROUTES AND / OR SITES CONSISTING OF # UNDERGROUND (UG) AND / OR OVERHEAD (OH) PLANT, AND / OR INSIDE\nPLANT, AND / OR CUSTOMER PREMISES EQUIPMENT. THE RATE INCLUDES BUT IS NOT LIMITED TO: PROCESSING OF ALL VARIATION ORDERS FOR THE\nDURATION OF THE PROJECT, CAPTURING/UPDATING OF ALL AS-BUILT PLANT / ELEMENTS AFTER COMPLETION OF THE WORK ON TELKOM APPROVED SYSTEM\nSOFTWARE (I.E. NETPLAN), TASKING TO ECC, ALL TRAVEL RELATED COSTS WITHIN A 50-KM RADIUS TO AND FROM THE SITE CALCULATED FROM THE\nFOLLOWING TOWNS: PRETORIA, MIDDELBURG, KLERKSDORP, POLOKWANE, VEREENIGING, RUSTENBURG, JOHANNESBURG, BELLVILLE (CAPE TOWN),\nWORCESTER, VREDENBURG, SWELLENDAM, ETHEKWINI (DURBAN), 